first

- npm install

on both client and root

install Ganache

open ganache with a custom "New Workspace" with ethereum of 1000

open Metamask

- click add a custom network
- give a name
- give the RPC URL from ganache
- give the chainID as 1337 if it is not automatically filled
- then click on save
- then click on the down arrow on the accont name
- click on the "+ Add account or hardware wallet"
- click on "import account"
- then go to ganache
- click on the "key icon"
- copy the private key
- paste it on metamask
- click import

now go to vs code

open a terminal
on the terminal

- npx truffle compile

- truffle migrate --reset --network development

this is compile and deploy the samrt contracts to the localnet

now go to ganache

- click on contracts tab

- click on "LINK TRUFFLE PROJECTS"

- click on "Add Project"

- navigate to the "truffle-config.js" file in the project directory

- select it and the click on "save and restart" or "save"

this will link the deployed contracts with the accounts so that we can interact with the contracts from the accounts in the ganache

now open a new terminal

- cd client

- npm run dev

- this will work perfectly but it wont send any email notification to the student

- to get the notification

- create a .env.local file inside client (on the same level as package.json)

- then
  EMAIL_USER=your-email
  EMAIL_PASSWORD=(your-app-password)

to create an app password search on the net or as AI or go to this link
https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords

and create one password and paste it in EMAIL_PASSWORD
